  "full_text": "So, Satan took Jesus up on the temple and said, if you worship me, I'll give you all this shit. So, Satan just offered me fast dominions. Basically, you know this concept of grace? This concept of grace that I tell you? Well, here's the deal. The angels will give you grace if you... play by their rules so basically it's uh if you uh if you do their uh if you do what the angels want they give you dominions but it's you just made yourself a slave to angels did you know that so like you can live every hour of the day as a slave to angels as reward you get grace like there was something i was uh somebody uh So as I was going through the day doing my web, doing my files, I realized, what if I tried to work a little harder? What if I tried to, what if I tried to, you know, I'm telling a tale. Anyway, so, fuck it, you know. Who's the boss, right? So, so what if I, so. If I tried to work hard and not make mistakes, what you've just done is make yourself a slave. So it's simple logic that if you act as a slave to God, you get a reward. So if you don't act as a slave to God, then they fuck with you. So when you're driving down the road, cars will start fucking with you. People start fucking with you. If you don't have grace, they fuck with you. But, so.",
